<title>CHINA: China Jan-Nov oil imports up 41.6 pct yr-on-yr.</title>
<headline>China Jan-Nov oil imports up 41.6 pct yr-on-yr.</headline>
<dateline>BEIJING 1996-12-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>China imported 20.53 million tonnes of crude oil in the first 11 months of this year, up 41.6 percent compared with the year-ago period, customs figures showed on Monday.</p>
<p>Crude oil imports in November alone were 2.12 million tonnes.</p>
<p>China's crude oil exports in the first 11 months reached 17.96 million tonnes, up 8.1 percent compared with the same year-ago period, the figures showed.</p>
<p>Exports in November alone were 1.41 million tonnes.</p>
</text>
